@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5000
@learnerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Sign in locally first; supply the development learner or admin authentication cookie.
@authCookie = replace-with-local-Lms.Web.Auth-cookie

### Owner or admin receives application/pdf with attachment disposition (200).
GET {{baseUrl}}/dev/certificates/{{learnerId}}/download
Cookie: Lms.Web.Auth={{authCookie}}

### A nonexistent or another learner's specimen returns 404.
GET {{baseUrl}}/dev/certificates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/download
Cookie: Lms.Web.Auth={{authCookie}}

### Anonymous requests redirect to sign-in; when the feature is disabled the route is absent.
GET {{baseUrl}}/dev/certificates/{{learnerId}}/download
